The idea of the circular economy is to maximise the use of otherwise unused resources such as cars.  Blablacar is a carpooling service platform that connects a small number of users to facilitate sharing travels. Platforms are an essential strategy to connect users' needs and facilitate public-private collaboration mechanisms. Based on the users, assets, and their dynamic behavior. The users act as customers, service providers, asset providers, or any mix of the above, making the supply-demand balance sensitive.